333
00:16:28,947 --> 00:16:30,365
Eso hacía mi madre.

334
00:16:30,449 --> 00:16:33,160
Y por lo general, yo solía recibir
los gritos. Así que no.

335
00:16:36,121 --> 00:16:37,080
Oye.

336
00:16:39,917 --> 00:16:41,001
¿La trajiste?

337
00:16:58,644 --> 00:16:59,686
Hola.

338
00:17:00,604 --> 00:17:03,065
Vine a usar tu impresora 3-D.
Será un segundo.

339
00:17:03,273 --> 00:17:05,483
